{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>which I shall do in its midst</b> — אשר has the gematria of דצ\"ך עד\"ש באח\"ב, which were inscribed in בקרבו. The plagues:"], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {0 "The acrostic דצ\"ך עד\"ש באח\"ב abbreviates the ten plagues: דם, צפרדע, כנים, ערוב, דבר, שחין, ברד, ארבה, חשך, בכורות. The comment is elliptical: the gematria of אשר equals the combined gematria of these plague-abbreviations, and these plagues were 'inscribed' (i.e., hinted at) within the word בקרבו."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:11:49.395637148Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}